  "source_sha256": "592de6a10d54a3a7e4e94fc6d3b241e45db99de27e7e0cdfa61edebb686a2ffd",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "282c9f60904e0dcabe492b5c4a510bcdee0ac0160926b2cafd4bdbf7abf32958",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nSnowy Zigzags",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "53c241b55043f59cebb4ea35608a83c536c74478c5a61f042c29110739cd9a8d",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit waved.\n“Welcome, Wukong!”\n“Welcome, Princess Iron Fan!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "61d2f1b16086eb538db8391763038f1bb46d3599a2461db79a18e3520fe99a28",
      "text": "Gold staff. Silver fan.\nThey put them in the cubby.\nBoots on. Skis ready.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f2d3cac74effb55c44f72d7fa5d7285b73df151c969bbf2e84864f3c45f9362",
      "text": "“My feet got long!” Wukong\nwobbled. His skis slid apart.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88a55d74469b4fd7137650cc262a4a77cd996be446b4d2312b9066a50d3aa420",
      "text": "Coach Otter checked helmets.\n“Stay on this little hill.”\nThey listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9e74ddf0b586d704c61e1b917291d09af866bcb20b7f62efe497208a5f5e1057",
      "text": "Wukong stepped too fast.\nPlop! A soft snow sit.\nHis tail wore a snowball.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11b55a83bb37c1a6440a0a64f965626d1d796d505306666a0b65f3f59a4e0ee1",
      "text": "Iron Fan sat in soft snow.\n“A soft seat!” she laughed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0fce558308e5a70ceb2ed4df3a1bd1a56a99831dc9eaa2bc6ee8e86c683eb43e",
      "text": "She stopped with a swish.\nThe turn looked big.\nCould she do it?",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc1cdb0937e24550bacd2eb18deed63bbfbae891695edcccd86bc5be2046cb72",
      "text": "Wukong bent his knees. “Easy,\nfeet!” He looked down the hill.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95228e6f3e52d301c59985bd6632822b3781c2bbfd5eabbdd240664dc3357dfb",
      "text": "Coach made a wide flag path.\nJade cheered from the side:\n“Take your time!”\nWukong listened.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "68f5be53fbe9aaaccc90b0ff5a83f7e3756a2760c43e153367647702e04abe59",
      "text": "Iron Fan breathed out.\nA little bend. A little turn.\nHer skis went around the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "99f615e45d71c70aff9375d93529d28eab26f97993cd0173a296329b377af80a",
      "text": "Wukong bent, then turned.\n“Slow. Turn. Stop.”\nHe stopped by the flag.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "aaf1bf9d94deeff9b1447721dc44e954c0ccbaa4f55d4d5081ee20c050ab4c70",
      "text": "They looked back.\nTwo tracks crossed the snow.\n“Two snowy ribbons!” said Jade.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2ab403688e66885a7ea2e376ad3692cc4fd4fb05f9d1f52566ee595451ef7ae",
      "text": "Three mugs of warm cocoa. A\nbowl of fish crackers. They\nblew gently. Sip, sip.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "77b015fe746c6d2deda4b0ad6dbb0ccdcaba4e81af8178f4c6e4be019a9597ed",
      "text": "“My fish can’t ski!” “Mine can\nswim... in my tummy!” Crunch,\ncrunch.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "310822167651ce45327cae9f5e0466cb52feb6519526a6a85c07b9856d7ac33f",
      "text": "They drew their snowy tracks.\nJade added tiny snowflakes.\nOutside, snow fell softly.\nInside, the cocoa stayed warm.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
